		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>When the moon rises on the longest night of the year, all goblins are filled with a primal, fiery power that lasts until dawn. On this night, the fire goblins burn! Triumphant goblins with crescent moon smiles and flickering eyes. </i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 5, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 club +0 (1d4) or 1 fire blast (far) +1 (1d6 + burn), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Keen Senses</strong>. Can’t be surprised.</p><p></p><p><strong>Burn</strong>. Flammable objects the target carries ignite (1d4 damage on turn).</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Art by Yuri Perkowski-Domingos, 2023</i></p>",
